---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SignUp from '../components/SignUp.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="Robert Hasleton writes hard science fiction. The Jovian Crisis is his first novel.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <article class="prose">
        <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
        <h1>Robert Hasleton</h1>
        <p class="lede">I'm Robert Hasleton. By day I build systems for Fortune 500 companies. Before the workday starts, I write.</p>
        <p>
          Jupiter is the largest world in the solar system, and most people never look up to find it. I started reading
          about it and never stopped. <em>The Jovian Crisis</em> is what happens when humanity finally shows up there,
          with enough time, technology and energy to stay.
        </p>
        <p>
          I live near Atlanta with my wife and children. When I'm not at Jupiter, my wife and I are training for our
          next half marathon.
        </p>
        <p>It's my first novel, and Book One of The Capa Incident.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <SignUp />
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
